WEBVTT

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.990
<i>The students of the Misfit Class 
were given a task.</i>

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:16.640
<i>If they do not all advance to the 
Dalet rank before their second year,</i>

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:22.350
<i>they will be kicked out of the Royal One, 
which they worked so hard to acquire.</i>

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.340
<i>Iruma and his friends must attempt 
the rank-advancement exams.</i>

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.950
<i>First up... The Harvest Festival!</i>

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:38.520
I love everyone in the 
Misfit Class very much!

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:42.020
<b>I love everyone very much</b>

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.980
I love everyone very much!

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:45.520
Anyway, thanks for the ingredients.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:50.940
I love her...

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:01.130
Lead-kun gave us some ingredients.

00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:02.740
Everything is going well.

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:04.240
Now, then...

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:07.580
I wonder if everything's 
going well for Clara-chan.

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:09.960
Um...

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:20.360
Boo!

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:21.230
Huh?

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.140
Iruma-chi captured!

00:02:56.030 --> 00:03:00.530
<b>Clara's Toy Box</b>

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:58.520
"Clara's Toy Box."

00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:05.020
C-Clara?

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:07.910
Got you, Iruma-chi!

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:09.320
You startled me!

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:12.160
I know, right? I did chomp you!

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:15.670
I haven't seen you in forever, 
Iruma-chi. There, there.

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:17.670
<i>I-It's so cramped...</i>

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.040
You know what?

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:24.090
I learned lots in training.

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:26.000
So, Iruma-chi...

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.060
Huh?

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.310
I'm gonna show you.

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:30.310
Huh?

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:34.560
Hey, wai—

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:42.270
Huh?

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:43.740
What?

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.200
What?!

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:50.040
Wha— I-Is this place...

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:54.640
Huh?

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:57.520
Iruma-chi!

00:03:58.290 --> 00:04:01.850
Okay! Let's play!

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:02.800
What?!

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:07.670
Welcome!

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:13.100
This is Clara's Toy Box, 
where anything I like can appear!

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:14.940
<i>Clara's Toy Box.</i>

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:18.670
<i>This combines the Valac family's 
bloodline ability, Toy Toy,</i>

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:18.920
<b>Summon        (Toy Toy)</b>

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:23.080
<i>and the art of illusion 
that she learned from Raim.</i>

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:26.860
<i>The only catch is Clara must 
drag her target into her clothes...</i>

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:32.250
<i>which means they've basically been 
dragged into Clara's magical pocket.</i>

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:39.650
And I turn whoever comes here into 
a child so they enjoy it to the fullest!

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:41.110
Wow!

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:44.280
Yeah, so let's play, Iruma-chi!

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:45.130
Huh?

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:46.760
There's lots to do!

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:49.120
A spiky ball! New and improved!

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:51.140
A chomp-and-nom picture book!

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:55.430
A blood-bath wife versus 
mother-in-law war house set.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.280
There's also...

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:00.170
A giant mosquito coil maze!

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:03.410
Tag with a caiman! That one has 66 courses!

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:06.960
Um, b-but right now, we're in the 
middle of the Harvest Festival and—

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:08.870
My personal recommendation is this!

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:13.890
<b>Hide-and-Flip!!</b>

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:13.890
<b>Reversi</b>

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:13.890
<b>Strike</b>

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:11.130
You play reversi while playing hide-and-seek!

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:13.970
You can even attack! 
The hide-and-flip game!

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:21.980
What the heck?! That sounds super fun!

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:22.520
Right?

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:24.660
I wanna play!

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:46.450
Orararara! Clararara!

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:49.690
Hup!

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:53.320
Go!

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.040
Go!

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:58.920
Say your prayers, Iruma-chi!

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.420
Hup!

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:05.800
Wh-Wha?!

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.350
Hup!

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:16.100
Hey, wait!

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:20.860
Go!

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:29.420
Yay!

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.300
No fair!

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:38.310
Listen, Baby-chan.

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:40.660
I'll teach you something very important.

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.280
Something important!

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:44.300
Your charms...

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:46.180
My charms...

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:48.430
...are that you're unrestrained and surprising.

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:51.170
Unrestrained and surprising?

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:55.670
If you can use those two things 
in your favor, any demon will fall...

00:06:55.670 --> 00:06:57.800
Any demon will fall?

00:06:57.800 --> 00:07:01.060
...head over heels for you.

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:03.570
Head over heely heely heels!

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:05.690
One day...

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.340
I'll make you fall head over heels for me!

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:13.000
Here we go! Whee!

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:15.240
Bring it!

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:21.080
Wh-Wha?! Now you've done it!

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:24.620
<i>Even Iruma knew deep down</i>

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:26.840
<i>that this was no time to be playing around.</i>

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:31.840
<i>But this space was filled with 
so many fun things that he...</i>

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:35.400
<i>couldn't help but want to play!</i>

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:44.310
Raim-sensei told me

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:48.240
I am Clara

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:54.560
I'm the Venus of the Land of Toys

00:07:55.300 --> 00:08:00.840
The always childlike Venus

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:05.470
That's me, Clara

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:10.680
Shall we play? Maybe not?

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:17.560
Let's play while you're here 
and play some more

00:08:17.570 --> 00:08:20.180
I wanna play some more

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:21.900
Let's play!

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:31.220
Fun toys and games come 
pouring out of my pockets

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:35.850
Clara clamor clamor Claara Claran

00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:38.680
Head head heady over heely heels

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:41.940
That's what you'll be for me, you'll see

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:47.640
I'll be waiting inside my toy box

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:52.330
I am Clara

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:56.240
I'm the Venus of the Land of Toys (Venus)

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:59.300
The always childlike Venus (Venus)

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:01.660
Clacky-clacky toys

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:07.200
But make sure you don't play 
too much (Wanna come play?)

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:13.950
But make sure you don't play 
too much (Wanna come play?)

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:19.960
But make sure you don't play 
too much (Wanna come play?)

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:24.680
<i>You just keep having fun, Iruma-chi.</i>

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:27.660
<i>So far, it's all going according 
to Master's plan!</i>

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:29.540
Head over heels!

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:36.090
<i>It was Raim who instructed her to create 
this space that's so fun, you can't stop.</i>

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:39.430
<i>The toy box that makes her 
targets play until they collapse.</i>

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:48.190
<i>This spell also has a terrifying side effect: 
it sucks out the mana of the one who's playing.</i>

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.290
Head over heels!

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:52.670
<i>Clara doesn't understand this very well.</i>

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:56.020
<i>Even when she was training 
with Raim-sensei...</i>

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:57.160
Head over heels!

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:59.030
Oh?

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:05.040
Yay! So cute!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:09.820
Head over heels! Head over heels! 
Head over heels! Head over heels!

00:10:09.820 --> 00:10:11.760
Head over heels! Head over heels!

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:15.040
Head over heels! Head over heels!

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:21.450
What a terrifying technique....

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:22.620
Head over heels?

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:25.010
Yes, I am...

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:27.090
Devi-yeah!

00:10:29.470 --> 00:10:31.840
<i>This is my chance with Iruma-chi!</i>

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:49.380
I did it!

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:51.090
Hi-yah!

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:52.510
Heely heels!

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:53.550
Hup!

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:55.010
Paim!

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:55.880
Hup!

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:56.760
Banaynay!

00:10:57.490 --> 00:10:58.170
Hup!

00:10:58.170 --> 00:10:58.950
Something!

00:10:58.950 --> 00:10:59.680
Hup!

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:00.630
Falfal!

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:00.630
Falfal!

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:03.240
Hup!

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:04.640
<i>I'll make him head over heels... 
head over heels...</i>

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:08.150
<i>Head over heels... head over heels...</i>

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:11.940
<i>Head over heels!</i>

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:19.650
<i>I collapsed, too.</i>

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:21.840
<i>Wait, when did that happen?!</i>

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:23.020
<i>Why?!</i>

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:27.600
<i>I was able to maintain my energy just 
fine with Nee-san and Master.</i>

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:28.970
Yay!

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:30.220
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:33.040
<i>If we play too much, 
Iruma-chi will lose too much mana?</i>

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:36.550
Iruma-chi! Iruma-chi, are you o—

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:37.590
Huh?!

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:41.760
Wow! We fell down!

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:44.420
I've never played so hard 
that I fell down before!

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:48.400
Clara, you're amazing! Yay!

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:50.310
Uh... eh?

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:52.060
<i>He's totally fine!</i>

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:53.430
Um, you know...

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:56.830
I'm really bad at playing,

00:11:57.360 --> 00:12:00.360
but it's so much fun playing with you!

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:03.480
I feel all warm and fuzzy inside, and happy...

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:06.070
You know...

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:10.580
I really love playing with you, Clara!

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:16.950
<i>I see...</i>

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:20.460
<i>Iruma-chi really is head over heels for me.</i>

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:24.880
<i>And... since I also collapsed...</i>

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:28.560
<i>That means I'm head over heels for him, too.</i>

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:31.100
<i>Mrr... That means it's a tie!</i>

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:35.190
<i>Boo. Oh well, I guess.</i>

00:12:35.970 --> 00:12:40.850
You know, I really love playing 
with you, too, Iruma-chi.

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:42.310
It's so much fun...

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:47.240
I love you the most.

00:12:58.280 --> 00:13:00.080
Good morning!

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:03.620
Oh, thank goodness!

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:05.970
You two finally woke up.

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:08.470
Huh? Huh?!

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:10.840
What?! It's already nighttime?!

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:15.760
<i>What would've happened 
if we'd kept playing?</i>

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:17.850
Iruma-ku...

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:19.850
Lead-kun?!

00:13:19.850 --> 00:13:21.220
Hiruma-fun...

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:23.360
Are you okay?! Hang in there!

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:25.360
Oh, fine.

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:29.220
I guess I'll let you off the hook for today.

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:36.620
Girl demons are...

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:39.470
<i>...terrifying.</i>

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:47.370
<i>The Charming Team gained 5,400 points.</i>

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:50.340
<i>The Feral Team now has zero.</i>

00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:02.270
<b>A Night Filled with Screams</b>

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:01.320
"A Night Filled with Screams."

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:05.920
<b>Day 1       Night</b>

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:05.920
Now, then...

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:10.650
It's a dark, creepy, anxious, lonely night...

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:14.680
But we're extremely busy!

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:19.410
The first night always leads 
to a ton of injuries!

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:22.650
I'm so tired.

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:27.120
Hey, this grass is nice and soft.

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:29.880
Sweet. I found a soft place to sleep.

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:39.050
<i>Nest Squirrels.</i>

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:45.320
<b>Nest Squirrel</b>

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:42.480
<i>Their big, round eyes see 
extremely well in the night,</i>

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:44.800
<i>and they come to steal 
their enemies' place of rest.</i>

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:51.120
<i>Steak Bats.</i>

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:55.080
<b>Steak Bats</b>

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:55.080
<i>They lure their prey in with their 
delicious smell and suck their blood.</i>

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:58.770
Run away!

00:14:58.770 --> 00:14:59.790
Over here!

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:00.580
Huh?

00:15:03.310 --> 00:15:05.650
I don't know who you are, but you saved us.

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:06.880
Yeah...

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.430
Wait, where are we?

00:15:08.750 --> 00:15:10.210
Over here...

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:12.840
Over here...

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:22.980
<b>Bird-Head Grass</b>

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:18.840
<i>Bird-Head Grass.</i>

00:15:18.840 --> 00:15:22.860
<i>Its bird head mimics a person's 
voice to lure over its prey.</i>

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:27.190
<i>Because they are physically 
weaker and their judgment</i>

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.680
<i>is clouded from moving around 
so much during the day,</i>

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:32.490
<i>the night does not let the 
weakened students escape.</i>

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:36.740
Panic brings even more panic, 
and they become disheartened.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:38.590
And when that happens...

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:46.000
I forfeit!

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:47.220
Cerberobuth!

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:55.670
This should be obvious, but you two won't 
be getting points for this magical beast.

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:57.170
Okay!

00:15:57.520 --> 00:15:58.940
Cerberobuth!

00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:00.940
Cerberobuth!

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:04.320
Kalego-sensei! Where are you?

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:07.070
You're so mean, leaving me behind!

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:08.530
Over here!

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:10.690
Oh, thank goodness!

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:13.690
There you are! Jeez...

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:15.620
Huh?

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:20.710
Kalego-sensei! Sensei! I forfeit!

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:20.700
For crying out loud...

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:23.530
<i>I can't believe even I have
 to go out into the field.</i>

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:25.260
Now, don't be like that...

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:26.560
<i>Cerberobuth!</i>

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:29.320
<i>Buer Blushenko of the rescue squad.</i>

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:33.220
<b>Semipermanence (Heal)</b>

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:31.040
<i>His ability is Heal.</i>

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:33.210
That's how it goes on the first day.

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:35.800
<i>Students forfeit one after another.</i>

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:38.290
Ow, ow, ow!

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:39.030
You'll just have to stick it out.

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:44.280
All of you who've been treated, 
head back to school in an orderly fashion.

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:47.730
Damn it! I couldn't get through day one.

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:49.560
So dumb...

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:53.800
This is where a fifth of the 
students forfeit every year.

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:57.330
I'm sure we'll start seeing 
the hallucination victims soon.

00:16:57.730 --> 00:17:00.160
Wow...

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:04.640
Such pretty flowers. Is this cotton candy?

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:10.500
This feels so nice. It must be paradise!

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:14.510
Hey!

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:16.480
Get a grip!

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:24.020
<b>Trippy Vine</b>

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:20.160
<i>Trippy Vine.</i>

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:24.010
<i>It surrounds its victims by making them
 hallucinate and devours them slowly.</i>

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:25.990
There's one over here, too!

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:27.800
Get a grip already!

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:29.520
Thank goodness we made it in time.

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:31.520
You have such pretty eyes.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:31.530
I love you.

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:34.740
I'm surrounded by good-looking men!

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:33.480
You're beautiful.

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:34.650
You're so beautiful.

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:34.600
You're lovely.

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:35.850
You're so pretty.

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:37.460
Over here! Over there! 
Flowers and butterflies!

00:17:35.850 --> 00:17:37.760
You're not going home tonight.

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:39.170
This world is nothing but springtime!

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:38.380
I love you.

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:40.010
I love you so much.

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:41.260
I love you, honey.

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:41.980
Come closer to me.

00:17:43.150 --> 00:17:44.560
Dosa-chan, snap out of it!

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:45.870
Wake up!

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:47.100
Dosa-chan!

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:49.670
Oh, girls...

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.750
Jeez, Dosa-chan.

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:53.800
You're daydreaming again.

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:56.680
We can't leave you alone for a second.

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:57.840
Right?

00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:00.430
Sorry, my bad. Tee-hee.

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:07.710
We definitely need his help for 
those who can't forfeit on their own.

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:11.470
Now, then...

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:14.940
Which student do I need to save next?

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:26.420
Hmm... I think that way.

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:27.800
Roger!

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:30.250
Thanks, buds.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.380
<i>Orias.</i>

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:34.080
<i>Bloodline ability: Lucky Happy.</i>

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:39.050
<b>Astrology    (Lucky Happy)</b>

00:18:34.350 --> 00:18:39.520
<i>He has absolute luck that causes 
everything to work in his favor.</i>

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:41.220
Found them!

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:42.990
Oh, lucky us.

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:44.480
Let's go for the next one.

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:45.310
Yes, sir.

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:49.380
<i>Ever since Orias was named director,</i>

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:53.100
<i>the number of casualties during the 
Harvest Festival has dropped tremendously.</i>

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:54.910
Heya.

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:56.480
Ah, Orias-sensei.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:58.080
How's it going?

00:18:58.080 --> 00:19:02.850
Well, we don't have to worry as long 
as we have you and Kalego-sensei.

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:07.080
You can't let your guard down like that.

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:08.210
Huh?

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:13.570
There are things that 
even my luck can't cover.

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:22.470
The nights of the Harvest Festival 
are far noisier than the mornings.

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:23.440
Yes.

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:28.520
The screams echo, and beasts search 
for their prey with gleaming eyes.

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:32.110
Once you lose your footing, you fall.

00:19:32.110 --> 00:19:33.800
That is part of the Harvest Festival.

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:38.440
I wonder how many students 
will forfeit tonight.

00:19:42.170 --> 00:19:43.950
I'm so tired.

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:46.180
I'm sticky with sweat.

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:48.320
I'm starving.

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:50.960
I can't... go on...

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:52.960
Do you want to forfeit?

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:54.840
I might be at my limit.

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:55.720
But...

00:19:56.210 --> 00:20:00.160
We might end up in different 
classes once we're second-years.

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:03.590
Let's try a little harder together.

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:07.470
Yeah. Just a little more.

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:09.400
Let's do our best—

00:20:13.110 --> 00:20:17.610
Let's forfeit after all!

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.840
What's that light?

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:31.220
It's a castle...

00:20:35.320 --> 00:20:38.090
Pardon us!

00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:52.680
No one's here...

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:56.640
What <i>is</i> this castle?

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:58.640
Who's there?

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:02.160
Who dares enter my 
castle with their shoes on

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:05.900
and wake me from my slumber?

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:14.660
Who the heck are you guys?

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:24.700
He's...

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:25.920
...so...

00:21:25.920 --> 00:21:29.480
...hot!

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:28.430
<b>He's So Hot</b>

00:21:29.820 --> 00:21:30.810
Huh?

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:36.390
He's truly the beautiful lad from 
the ancient myths of the netherworld!

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:39.870
The one who was so beautiful 
that he was put to sleep forever!

00:21:41.380 --> 00:21:45.450
Endymion-sama!

00:21:52.110 --> 00:21:54.900
Seriously, who <i>are</i> you people?

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:57.800
Endymion-sama!

00:21:57.800 --> 00:21:59.350
Who the hell is that?!

00:23:29.960 --> 00:23:33.590
Su-ki-ma, yes, su-ki-ma.

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:34.180
<b>Su</b>

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:34.180
<b>Ki</b>

00:23:32.510 --> 00:23:34.180
<b>Ma</b>

00:23:39.680 --> 00:23:41.930
Rock, paper...

00:23:41.930 --> 00:23:43.400
scissors!

00:23:43.400 --> 00:23:45.610
Yay! I won, I won!

00:23:45.610 --> 00:23:48.730
Paper covers rock, so paper wins!

00:23:50.720 --> 00:23:53.930
Rock can make rock-grilled 
sweet potatoes, so rock wins!

00:23:53.930 --> 00:23:55.480
Yay, yay!

00:23:55.480 --> 00:23:57.280
Woohoo!

00:23:55.480 --> 00:23:57.280
Huh? Wha...?

00:23:57.280 --> 00:24:00.810
<i>Clara's Toy Box is meant to be nonsensical.</i>

00:23:59.440 --> 00:24:00.310
Huh?

00:24:00.810 --> 00:24:01.800
Huh?

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:27.980
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:24:03.470 --> 00:24:05.720
Oh... Everyone is filled with bloodlust.

00:24:05.720 --> 00:24:07.910
Come now, here are some eyedrops.

00:24:07.910 --> 00:24:09.680
Close your eyes.

00:24:09.680 --> 00:24:12.100
You feel the love overwhelming 
your body, don't you?

00:24:12.480 --> 00:24:17.640
Now, open your eyes. 
The first one you see is me...

00:24:17.960 --> 00:24:19.920
Next time on <i>Welcome to 
Demon School! Iruma-kun,</i>

00:24:19.920 --> 00:24:22.980
"Can We Make 100 Friends?" 
and "The Students I'm Proud Of."

00:24:22.980 --> 00:24:26.230
Let's hold hands and go forth together.
